---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="About Startup Weekend Brussels - Global Entrepreneurship Movement"
  description="Learn about Startup Weekend Brussels, part of the global movement that has created 25,000+ startups in 3,000+ cities. Join 54 hours of entrepreneurship in Brussels."
  canonical="https://startupweekend.brussels/about"
  breadcrumbs={[{name: "About Startup Weekend", url: "/about"}]}
>
  <!-- Hero Section -->
  <section class="bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-600 to-purple-600 text-white py-16">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="text-center">
        <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold mb-6">
          About Startup Weekend
        </h1>
        <p class="text-xl md:text-2xl text-blue-100 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
          The world's largest community of passionate entrepreneurs learning the basics of founding startups and launching successful ventures.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- What is Startup Weekend -->
  <section class="py-16 bg-white">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center">
        <div>
          <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6">
            What is Startup Weekend?
          </h2>
          <p class="text-lg text-gray-600 mb-6">
            Startup Weekend is a 54-hour event where entrepreneurs, developers, designers, marketers, product managers, and startup enthusiasts come together to share ideas, form teams, build products, and launch startups.
          </p>
          <p class="text-lg text-gray-600 mb-6">
            It's not just about the weekend - it's about building a community of like-minded individuals who will continue to work together, teach each other, and celebrate each other's successes for years to come.
          </p>
          <div class="bg-blue-50 border-l-4 border-blue-600 p-4">
            <p class="text-blue-800 font-semibold">
              "The best way to predict the future is to create it." - Startup Weekend Motto
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-gray-100 rounded-lg p-8">
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6">The Weekend Journey</h3>
          <div class="space-y-6">
            <div class="flex items-start space-x-4">
              <div class="bg-blue-600 text-white w-8 h-8 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-sm">1</div>
              <div>
                <h4 class="font-semibold text-gray-900">Friday Evening: Pitch & Team Formation</h4>
                <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm">60-second pitches, voting, and team formation around the best ideas.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-start space-x-4">
              <div class="bg-purple-600 text-white w-8 h-8 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-sm">2</div>
              <div>
                <h4 class="font-semibold text-gray-900">Saturday: Build & Validate</h4>
                <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm">Intense development, customer discovery, and business model validation.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-start space-x-4">
              <div class="bg-green-600 text-white w-8 h-8 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-sm">3</div>
              <div>
                <h4 class="font-semibold text-gray-900">Sunday: Present & Launch</h4>
                <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm">5-minute final presentations to judges, awards, and celebration.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Global Impact -->
  <section class="py-16 bg-gray-50">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="text-center mb-12">
        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">
          Global Impact & Success Stories
        </h2>
        <p class="text-xl text-gray-600 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
          Since 2007, Startup Weekend has grown into a global movement with incredible success stories
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-8 mb-12">
        <div class="text-center">
          <div class="text-4xl font-bold text-blue-600 mb-2">3000+</div>
          <p class="text-gray-600">Cities Reached</p>
        </div>
        <div class="text-center">
          <div class="text-4xl font-bold text-purple-600 mb-2">1M+</div>
          <p class="text-gray-600">Entrepreneurs Trained</p>
        </div>
        <div class="text-center">
          <div class="text-4xl font-bold text-green-600 mb-2">25K+</div>
          <p class="text-gray-600">Startups Launched</p>
        </div>
        <div class="text-center">
          <div class="text-4xl font-bold text-yellow-600 mb-2">$100M+</div>
          <p class="text-gray-600">Funding Raised</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-white rounded-lg shadow-lg p-8">
        <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6 text-center">Notable Success Stories</h3>
        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
          <div class="text-center">
            <h4 class="font-semibold text-lg text-gray-900 mb-2">Zaarly</h4>
            <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm">Founded at Startup Weekend, raised $14.1M in funding</p>
          </div>
          <div class="text-center">
            <h4 class="font-semibold text-lg text-gray-900 mb-2">Foodspotting</h4>
            <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm">Started at SW, acquired by OpenTable for $10M</p>
          </div>
          <div class="text-center">
            <h4 class="font-semibold text-lg text-gray-900 mb-2">Next Big Sound</h4>
            <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm">SW alumni, acquired by Pandora</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Why Participate -->
  <section class="py-16 bg-white">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="text-center mb-12">
        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">
          Why Participate in Startup Weekend?
        </h2>
      </div>

      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
        <div class="bg-blue-50 rounded-lg p-6">
          <div class="text-3xl mb-4">🚀</div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-3">Launch Your Idea</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600">
            Turn your business idea into reality with the help of talented teammates and experienced mentors.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-purple-50 rounded-lg p-6">
          <div class="text-3xl mb-4">🤝</div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-3">Build Your Network</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600">
            Connect with entrepreneurs, developers, designers, and potential co-founders in your city.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-green-50 rounded-lg p-6">
          <div class="text-3xl mb-4">📚</div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-3">Learn by Doing</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600">
            Gain hands-on experience in lean startup methodology, customer development, and rapid prototyping.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-yellow-50 rounded-lg p-6">
          <div class="text-3xl mb-4">🎯</div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-3">Test Your Skills</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600">
            Challenge yourself in a supportive environment and discover new talents you didn't know you had.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-red-50 rounded-lg p-6">
          <div class="text-3xl mb-4">🏆</div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-3">Win Prizes</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600">
            Compete for cash prizes, incubator opportunities, and mentorship from successful entrepreneurs.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-indigo-50 rounded-lg p-6">
          <div class="text-3xl mb-4">🌟</div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-3">Have Fun</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600">
            Enjoy an incredible weekend with passionate people who share your enthusiasm for innovation.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Brussels Connection -->
  <section class="py-16 bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-600 to-purple-600 text-white">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="text-center">
        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold mb-6">
          Why Brussels?
        </h2>
        <p class="text-xl text-blue-100 max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-8">
          Brussels is the perfect location for Startup Weekend - a vibrant tech ecosystem, international business hub, and home to innovative entrepreneurs from across Europe.
        </p>
        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 mt-12">
          <div class="text-center">
            <div class="text-3xl mb-4">🇪🇺</div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-2">European Capital</h3>
            <p class="text-blue-100">Heart of Europe with access to EU institutions and international networks</p>
          </div>
          <div class="text-center">
            <div class="text-3xl mb-4">💼</div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-2">Tech Hub</h3>
            <p class="text-blue-100">Growing startup ecosystem with major tech companies and innovation centers</p>
          </div>
          <div class="text-center">
            <div class="text-3xl mb-4">🌍</div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-2">Multicultural</h3>
            <p class="text-blue-100">Diverse community of international professionals and entrepreneurs</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA -->
  <section class="py-16 bg-gray-50">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center">
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">
        Ready to Join the Movement?
      </h2>
      <p class="text-xl text-gray-600 mb-8">
        Be part of Startup Weekend Brussels 2026 and turn your ideas into reality alongside passionate entrepreneurs.
      </p>
      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 justify-center">
        <a href="/2026-edition#register" class="bg-blue-600 text-white px-8 py-3 rounded-lg font-semibold hover:bg-blue-700 transition-colors">
          Pre-Register for 2026
        </a>
        <a href="/2026-edition" class="border-2 border-blue-600 text-blue-600 px-8 py-3 rounded-lg font-semibold hover:bg-blue-600 hover:text-white transition-colors">
          Learn About 2026 Edition
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>